{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roach Post</strong> is a roguelike puzzle game where you use <strong>polyomino</strong>-shaped stamps to teleport packages, earning points through clever combinations of shapes, colors, and hardworking roach assistants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/roach.gif?t=1744980445\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc1c Welcome to Roach Post!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as <strong>Polly</strong>, a magical mail carrier.<br>Together with your trusty sidekick \u2014 a cockroach named <strong>Mino</strong> \u2014 you\u2019ll teleport letters and packages using enchanted polyomino stamps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2709\ufe0f Place stamps \u2014 gain power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stamp you place on a package gives you <strong>power</strong>.<br>Earn enough power, and the package gets sent!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 Color interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stamps in <i>Roach Post</i> aren't just colorful \u2014 their hues <strong>interact</strong>:<br>some combinations <strong>boost</strong> your power, others <strong>weaken</strong> it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udce6 Build your deck of stamps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before each run, you choose which stamps to bring on your shift.<br><strong>Craft your strategy</strong> by mixing shapes, colors, and special effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc1e Roach Workers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to stamps, you can bring along <strong>roach workers</strong> \u2014<br>tiny helpers with big effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect your favorite roaches, combine their abilities, and deliver every last package with style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514630?t=1744980445","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514630?t=1744980445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/a9c91b744b0b39be9e24e40b7b87914ba44b297f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744980445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/a9c91b744b0b39be9e24e40b7b87914ba44b297f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744980445","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roach Post</strong> is a roguelike puzzle game where you use <strong>polyomino</strong>-shaped stamps to teleport packages, earning points through clever combinations of shapes, colors, and hardworking roach assistants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/roach.gif?t=1744980445\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc1c Welcome to Roach Post!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as <strong>Polly</strong>, a magical mail carrier.<br>Together with your trusty sidekick \u2014 a cockroach named <strong>Mino</strong> \u2014 you\u2019ll teleport letters and packages using enchanted polyomino stamps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2709\ufe0f Place stamps \u2014 gain power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stamp you place on a package gives you <strong>power</strong>.<br>Earn enough power, and the package gets sent!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 Color interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stamps in <i>Roach Post</i> aren't just colorful \u2014 their hues <strong>interact</strong>:<br>some combinations <strong>boost</strong> your power, others <strong>weaken</strong> it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udce6 Build your deck of stamps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before each run, you choose which stamps to bring on your shift.<br><strong>Craft your strategy</strong> by mixing shapes, 